@startuml
title Corporate Governance & Security Audit Trail Workflow

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam ActivityFontColor #0f172a
skinparam ActivityFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityFontStyle bold

skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #1d4ed8
skinparam SwimlaneWidth 220
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontColor #1e3a8a
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontSize 14
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5

|HR Manager|
start
:Publish Revised Labor Law & Data Privacy Policy;

|Employee|
:Review Policy Terms & Submit Digital Sign-off;

|System Administrator|
:Configure Dynamic UI Data Masking for PII Fields;
:Monitor Real-time Security Audit Logs & Events;
if (Security Anomaly Detected?) then (Anomaly)
  :Trigger Security Incident Alert Email;
  :Lock Suspicious Session;
else (Normal)
  :Archive Immutable Security Audit Log Entry;
endif

|HR Manager|
:Export Security Compliance Audit Report;
stop
@enduml
